      <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.743.10 specifies the general framework, scenarios and requirements for mobile edge computing- (MEC-)enabled content delivery networks (CDNs). Recommendation ITU‑T F.743.10 also specifies the requirements for MEC functions on which a CDN edge node relies. The deployment of a CDN edge node with an MEC system is described in the general framework. Several use cases are introduced in Recommendation ITU-T F.743.10 to illustrate the usage of MEC-enabled CDN.</abstract>
